cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "passmcp-census: the passmcp reliability census of the MCP Registry's remote servers"
message: >-
  If you use the census data, please cite it using these metadata and name
  the edition (data/<edition>/) you used.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/passmcp-census"
url: "https://sebastienrousseau.com/passmcp-census/"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate reliability figures for the remote MCP servers listed in the
  official MCP Registry, each checked by a released passmcp read-only and
  without credentials. Each edition publishes counts and rates by outcome,
  check, phase, transport and authorization scheme, with no server
  identified, plus the passmcp version, the registry snapshot time and the
  command that reproduces it. The data is CC-BY-4.0 and the tooling
  Apache-2.0. Release 0.0.2 ships the tooling and methodology; no edition
  has been published yet.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - mcp-registry
  - reliability
  - census
  - dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.0.2
date-released: 2026-09-29
